bottom:16px\">Typical tools</p><div class=\"chiprow \"><span>Revit</span><span>AutoCAD</span><span>IFC</span></div></div>  </div>\n</div></section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"coal pad\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">Delivery workflow</p><h2 class=\"h2\">How Revit Family Creation <em>runs.</em></h2></div><p class=\"lead\">Five stages, with QA/QC before anything is issued.</p></div>\n  <div class=\"flow f5\"><div class=\"rv\"><b>01</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">Scope &amp; BEP</h3><p>Confirm deliverables, LOD/LOI matrix and standards.</p></div></div><div class=\"rv\"><b>02</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">Brief</h3><p>Source drawings, dimensions, parameters, LOD and Revit version agreed for each family.</p></div></div><div class=\"rv\"><b>03</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">Build</h3><p>Families modelled with clean geometry, shared parameters, types and visibility settings.</p></div></div><div class=\"rv\"><b>04</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">QA/QC</h3><p>Run model health, standards and clash checks before issue.</p></div></div><div class=\"rv\"><b>05</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">Test</h3><p>Each family flexed and tested in a project before delivery as .rfa, or as a library.</p></div></div></div>\n</div></section>\n\n\n<section class=\"pad\"><div class=\"wrap pn\">\n  <a href=\"/bim-services/clash-detection/\"><img width=\"1920\" height=\"1281\" src=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-coord.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"Engineer coordinating an MEP model across two screens\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width:900px) 100vw, 50vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-coord.jpg 1920w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-coord-300x200.jpg 300w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-coord-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-coord-768x512.jpg 768w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-coord-1536x1025.jpg 1536w\" /><span class=\"lab\">Previous service</span><h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">BIM Clash Detection</h2></a>\n  <a href=\"/bim-services/cad-to-bim/\"><img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" src=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-c-hand.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"Aerial view of a completed villa roof and terraces at night\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width:900px) 100vw, 50vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-c-hand.jpg 1920w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-c-hand-300x169.jpg 300w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-c-hand-1024x576.jpg 1024w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-c-hand-768x432.jpg 768w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-c-hand-1536x864.jpg 1536w\" /><span class=\"lab\">Next service</span><h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">CAD to BIM Conversion</h2></a>\n</div></section>\n","cta":"<img class=\"bg\" srcset=\"/assets/img/dxb-night-960.jpg 960w, /assets/img/dxb-night.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"100vw\" src=\"/assets/img/dxb-night.jpg\" alt=\"Dubai Marina towers lit at night\" loading=\"lazy\">    <p class=\"lab\">Next step</p><h2 class=\"display\" style=\"margin-top:20px\">Start your <em>revit family creation scope.</em></h2>\n    <div class=\"btns\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/request-talent/\">Request BIM professionals <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a><a class=\"btn ghost\" href=\"tel:+971588672901\">+971 58 867 2901</a></div>"}